    <tags>slack chat terminal tui cli huddles</tags>
    <summary>Slack client for the terminal. Note: choco uninstall ttyak also deletes your ttyak data.</summary>
    <description>A Slack client for the terminal: messaging with threads, reactions, autocomplete and formatting; inline images, an image viewer and video with sound; desktop notifications; search; and huddles with audio.

choco uninstall ttyak also deletes your ttyak data (settings, sign-ins of every profile, drafts, caches and logs), as `ttyak purge` does, for the user who runs choco. choco upgrade ttyak keeps it.</description>
    <releaseNotes>{{notes}}</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
